<title>USA: FGIC qualifies five muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies five muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Culver City Unified School District, Calif., $10 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Fresno Unified School District, Calif., $30 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Downers Grove Park District, Ill., $3 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Montclair Township, N.J., $5.786 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Montclair Township, N.J., $7.627 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
